ACORN 1.0 IWML 1.0
Features.Templates.Internal.Index
  SimpleStack
    Text This is an inline template. The HTML is not from a URL, but is included in the IWML.
    Template
      HTML:
        <html>
          <head></head>
        <body>
        <h2>Inline Template</h2>
        <p>IWML says: <span style="color:red">{%Text1%}</span>. The previous text came from an IWML control.</p>
        <p>You can embed any control you want. Enter your name: {%Edit1%}, and here is a button {%Button1%}</p>
        <h2>Modify HTML Elements</h2>
        <p>This paragraph is entirely HTML, <b><span id="Target">Target Area</span></b> but can still be modified by IntraWeb code.</p>
        <p>This text {%Edit2%} will be inserted above when you press this button {%Button2%}</p>
        </body></html>
      Text:Text1 Hello World!
      Edit:Edit1 <name>
      Button:Button1 Say Hello
      Edit:Edit2 From IntraWeb
      Button:Button2 Go!